  "overview": "Associate Professor Pediatric Pulmonologist at the University of Alabama at Birmingham, AL, USA. He is an attending physician at Children's of Alabama and Physician-Scientist with NIH funding. Experienced in Translational and Clinical Research of Pediatric Pulmonary Diseases. HIs research focuses on pulmonary complications of Sickle Cell Disease and Pediatric Pulmonary Hypertension. \nHe is the Medical Director of the Pulmonary Sickle Cell Disease Program and the Pediatric Pulmonary Hypertension Program at UAB and Children's of Alabama. His research funded by the NIH in addition to other funding sources. He has American Board certification in Pediatrics and Pediatric Pulmonology.",
